{"video_id":"Iwe_RY-fYgI","title":"AI-Driven Multi-Document Correlation for Financial Compliance - Varsha Shah, Independent","conference":"ai-engineer","language":"en","auto_generated":true,"source":"supa","timing":"exact","word_count":2314,"segments":[{"start":4.04,"duration":4.32,"text":"Hello everyone."},{"start":5.92,"duration":4.72,"text":"Thank you to the AI engineering"},{"start":8.36,"duration":3.84,"text":"world fair team for providing this"},{"start":10.64,"duration":3.92,"text":"wonderful opportunity to share my"},{"start":12.2,"duration":4.6,"text":"research. It is truly an honor to be"},{"start":14.56,"duration":4.44,"text":"speaking alongside so many talented"},{"start":16.8,"duration":3.72,"text":"researchers and practitioners. My name"},{"start":19.0,"duration":3.24,"text":"is Varsha Shah."},{"start":20.52,"duration":3.68,"text":"I am an enterprise technical architect"},{"start":22.24,"duration":3.76,"text":"working at Tata Consultancy Services"},{"start":24.2,"duration":5.2,"text":"working for Microsoft."},{"start":26.0,"duration":5.88,"text":"I'm focused on artificial intelligence"},{"start":29.4,"duration":5.12,"text":"enterprise compliance, finance"},{"start":31.88,"duration":4.76,"text":"governance, and intelligent automation."},{"start":34.52,"duration":5.24,"text":"Today, I would like to share my research"},{"start":36.64,"duration":5.28,"text":"on AI-driven multi-document correlation"},{"start":39.76,"duration":3.68,"text":"for enterprise financial compliance and"},{"start":41.92,"duration":4.56,"text":"fraud detection."},{"start":43.44,"duration":5.4,"text":"As organizations continue to digitalize"},{"start":46.48,"duration":4.84,"text":"their operations today, they generate a"},{"start":48.84,"duration":4.88,"text":"numerous amount of data"},{"start":51.32,"duration":5.04,"text":"for the financial system across payroll,"},{"start":53.72,"duration":5.44,"text":"tax, procurement, transaction system."},{"start":56.36,"duration":4.8,"text":"Ironically, while we have more data than"},{"start":59.16,"duration":4.24,"text":"ever before, compliance teams continue"},{"start":61.16,"duration":3.92,"text":"to struggle with hidden fraud patterns,"},{"start":63.4,"duration":3.76,"text":"regulatory risk."},{"start":65.08,"duration":4.28,"text":"The reason is the most"},{"start":67.16,"duration":4.96,"text":"existing solution analyze the documents"},{"start":69.36,"duration":5.2,"text":"independently. While many of the most"},{"start":72.12,"duration":4.4,"text":"critical risk only become visible when"},{"start":74.56,"duration":3.48,"text":"the information is connected across the"},{"start":76.52,"duration":4.08,"text":"multiple systems."},{"start":78.04,"duration":4.36,"text":"In this presentation, I'll introduce you"},{"start":80.6,"duration":3.72,"text":"to a framework that combines the"},{"start":82.4,"duration":3.52,"text":"graph-based entity"},{"start":84.32,"duration":3.32,"text":"correlation,"},{"start":85.92,"duration":3.84,"text":"probabilistic risk modeling, and"},{"start":87.64,"duration":4.24,"text":"cross-jurisdictional normalization to"},{"start":89.76,"duration":4.64,"text":"uncover these hidden relationships and"},{"start":91.88,"duration":4.6,"text":"transform enterprise compliance from"},{"start":94.4,"duration":4.32,"text":"reactive process into proactive"},{"start":96.48,"duration":6.24,"text":"intelligence capability. The framework"},{"start":98.72,"duration":6.56,"text":"was evaluated using approximately 3"},{"start":102.72,"duration":3.96,"text":"million financial records across four"},{"start":105.28,"duration":3.44,"text":"jurisdictional"},{"start":106.68,"duration":3.96,"text":"demonstrating both the strong detection"},{"start":108.72,"duration":4.08,"text":"performance and meaningful operations"},{"start":110.64,"duration":3.36,"text":"improvement. With that context, let's"},{"start":112.8,"duration":3.28,"text":"begin"},{"start":114.0,"duration":6.0,"text":"by looking at the compliance gap that"},{"start":116.08,"duration":3.92,"text":"organizations continue to face today."},{"start":121.16,"duration":3.48,"text":"Let's begin by understanding the"},{"start":122.56,"duration":4.44,"text":"compliance gap that many organizations"},{"start":124.64,"duration":4.64,"text":"continue to face. Enterprise compliance"},{"start":127.0,"duration":4.68,"text":"has become significantly more complex"},{"start":129.28,"duration":4.8,"text":"over the last decade. Organizations now"},{"start":131.68,"duration":4.48,"text":"operate across multiple countries,"},{"start":134.08,"duration":4.32,"text":"regulatory frameworks, and financial"},{"start":136.16,"duration":4.56,"text":"system, each with own reporting"},{"start":138.4,"duration":3.88,"text":"standards and compliance requirements."},{"start":140.72,"duration":4.96,"text":"At the same time, the volume of the"},{"start":142.28,"duration":5.12,"text":"enterprise has grown exponentially."},{"start":145.68,"duration":4.12,"text":"Payroll records, tax filings,"},{"start":147.4,"duration":5.04,"text":"procurement transactions, and financial"},{"start":149.8,"duration":4.6,"text":"documents are generated every day,"},{"start":152.44,"duration":5.04,"text":"making manual reviews both"},{"start":154.4,"duration":5.92,"text":"time-consuming and increasingly"},{"start":157.48,"duration":5.32,"text":"impractical. Adding to this challenge,"},{"start":160.32,"duration":5.68,"text":"fraud has been evolved."},{"start":162.8,"duration":5.76,"text":"Modern fraud rarely appears as an"},{"start":166.0,"duration":5.72,"text":"obvious error within a single document."},{"start":168.56,"duration":5.8,"text":"Instead, it exploits subtle"},{"start":171.72,"duration":4.64,"text":"inconsistency across multiple system."},{"start":174.36,"duration":3.4,"text":"Patterns that often remain invisible"},{"start":176.36,"duration":2.76,"text":"when the records are reviewed"},{"start":177.76,"duration":4.92,"text":"independently."},{"start":179.12,"duration":5.92,"text":"This creates a fundamental limitation."},{"start":182.68,"duration":5.0,"text":"Traditional rule-based and"},{"start":185.04,"duration":5.08,"text":"document-level NLP system are designed"},{"start":187.68,"duration":4.76,"text":"to validate individual records,"},{"start":190.12,"duration":4.4,"text":"but they are not built to understand"},{"start":192.44,"duration":4.36,"text":"relationship across the documents. And"},{"start":194.52,"duration":4.96,"text":"that's the gap this research aims to"},{"start":196.8,"duration":4.88,"text":"address. Moving beyond this isolated"},{"start":199.48,"duration":4.28,"text":"document analysis to uncover the hidden"},{"start":201.68,"duration":4.2,"text":"risk through the cross-document"},{"start":203.76,"duration":3.88,"text":"correlation. To better understand this"},{"start":205.88,"duration":4.68,"text":"limitation, let's look at why"},{"start":207.64,"duration":4.84,"text":"traditional document level analysis"},{"start":210.56,"duration":5.52,"text":"often fail to detect the most"},{"start":212.48,"duration":3.6,"text":"sophisticated fraud patterns."},{"start":216.96,"duration":4.36,"text":"To understand why traditional approaches"},{"start":218.8,"duration":4.64,"text":"struggle, let's consider how most"},{"start":221.32,"duration":3.36,"text":"compliance system operates"},{"start":223.44,"duration":3.0,"text":"nowadays."},{"start":224.68,"duration":4.64,"text":"They evaluate each document"},{"start":226.44,"duration":5.48,"text":"independently. A payroll register is"},{"start":229.32,"duration":4.76,"text":"validated against the payroll rules. The"},{"start":231.92,"duration":4.8,"text":"vendor invoices are checked against the"},{"start":234.08,"duration":5.28,"text":"procurement policies. A tax filing is"},{"start":236.72,"duration":4.68,"text":"reviewed under the tax regulations. If"},{"start":239.36,"duration":4.04,"text":"each document passes its individual"},{"start":241.4,"duration":3.76,"text":"validation, the transaction is generally"},{"start":243.4,"duration":4.08,"text":"considered compliant."},{"start":245.16,"duration":5.16,"text":"The challenge is that many sophisticated"},{"start":247.48,"duration":5.04,"text":"fraud patterns doesn't"},{"start":250.32,"duration":3.92,"text":"really appear within a single document."},{"start":252.52,"duration":3.84,"text":"They emerges only when the multiple"},{"start":254.24,"duration":4.36,"text":"documents are analyzed together. For"},{"start":256.36,"duration":4.84,"text":"example, a payroll record may appear"},{"start":258.6,"duration":4.52,"text":"accurate to us. A"},{"start":261.2,"duration":5.12,"text":"vendor invoice may seem legitimate to"},{"start":263.12,"duration":5.84,"text":"us. A tax filing may be correctly"},{"start":266.32,"duration":4.44,"text":"submitted. But, when these records are"},{"start":268.96,"duration":4.08,"text":"connected, they're revealing the"},{"start":270.76,"duration":4.6,"text":"inconsistencies and indicate the fraud"},{"start":273.04,"duration":4.92,"text":"and compliance risk. The information"},{"start":275.36,"duration":4.72,"text":"already exists. What missing is the"},{"start":277.96,"duration":4.36,"text":"ability to understand the relationship"},{"start":280.08,"duration":4.72,"text":"between these documents. That is why the"},{"start":282.32,"duration":4.28,"text":"research shifts the focus from document"},{"start":284.8,"duration":4.16,"text":"level validation to cross document"},{"start":286.6,"duration":5.32,"text":"intelligence, enabling the organizations"},{"start":288.96,"duration":5.96,"text":"to detect the risk that would otherwise"},{"start":291.92,"duration":5.48,"text":"remain hidden. So, if the problem is"},{"start":294.92,"duration":4.44,"text":"understanding relationships rather than"},{"start":297.4,"duration":4.04,"text":"individual documents, what kind of"},{"start":299.36,"duration":5.88,"text":"architecture can solve this? Let me"},{"start":301.44,"duration":5.28,"text":"introduce you to the framework."},{"start":305.24,"duration":3.72,"text":"Now that we have established the"},{"start":306.72,"duration":4.16,"text":"problem, let's look at the proposed"},{"start":308.96,"duration":4.52,"text":"framework. Rather than relying on a"},{"start":310.88,"duration":4.56,"text":"single model or algorithm, the solution"},{"start":313.48,"duration":4.16,"text":"is built on three"},{"start":315.44,"duration":4.44,"text":"complementary components that work"},{"start":317.64,"duration":4.28,"text":"together to transform the raw enterprise"},{"start":319.88,"duration":4.28,"text":"data into the actionable compliance"},{"start":321.92,"duration":4.28,"text":"intelligence. The first component is the"},{"start":324.16,"duration":3.0,"text":"entity correlation engine."},{"start":326.2,"duration":3.04,"text":"It"},{"start":327.16,"duration":4.44,"text":"the purpose of this is to connect the"},{"start":329.24,"duration":4.64,"text":"related information across the payroll,"},{"start":331.6,"duration":5.52,"text":"tax, procurement, financial systems,"},{"start":333.88,"duration":5.8,"text":"creating a unified view of enterprise"},{"start":337.12,"duration":4.12,"text":"activity rather than isolated records."},{"start":339.68,"duration":3.56,"text":"Once these relationships are"},{"start":341.24,"duration":5.36,"text":"established, the second component that"},{"start":343.24,"duration":5.76,"text":"is adaptive probabilistic risk model"},{"start":346.6,"duration":4.24,"text":"which is which evaluates the connected"},{"start":349.0,"duration":4.44,"text":"data to determine which pattern"},{"start":350.84,"duration":5.16,"text":"represent meaningful compliance."},{"start":353.44,"duration":4.8,"text":"Instead of generating alerts based on"},{"start":356.0,"duration":4.28,"text":"single rule, it"},{"start":358.24,"duration":4.72,"text":"it prioritizes the cases using the"},{"start":360.28,"duration":5.28,"text":"multiple risk signals here."},{"start":362.96,"duration":5.64,"text":"The cross-jurisdictional normalization"},{"start":365.56,"duration":5.16,"text":"layer provides the regulatory context by"},{"start":368.6,"duration":4.68,"text":"standardizing the currency, tax"},{"start":370.72,"duration":4.24,"text":"structure, reporting standards,"},{"start":373.28,"duration":4.12,"text":"and compliance rules across the"},{"start":374.96,"duration":5.4,"text":"different jurisdictions. This ensures"},{"start":377.4,"duration":5.0,"text":"that the risk are evaluated consistently"},{"start":380.36,"duration":4.28,"text":"regardless of where the transaction"},{"start":382.4,"duration":3.92,"text":"originated."},{"start":384.64,"duration":4.56,"text":"So, individually, each component"},{"start":386.32,"duration":5.32,"text":"provides a value. Together, they enable"},{"start":389.2,"duration":4.24,"text":"the framework that move beyond the"},{"start":391.64,"duration":4.32,"text":"document validation and towards the"},{"start":393.44,"duration":4.32,"text":"enterprise-wide compliance intelligence."},{"start":395.96,"duration":4.72,"text":"In the next few slides, I'll briefly"},{"start":397.76,"duration":4.76,"text":"explain you how each of these components"},{"start":400.68,"duration":3.96,"text":"contribute to the process. So, let's"},{"start":402.52,"duration":4.24,"text":"begin with the foundation of the"},{"start":404.64,"duration":4.2,"text":"framework, the entity correlation"},{"start":406.76,"duration":5.28,"text":"engine, which makes the cross-document"},{"start":408.84,"duration":3.2,"text":"intelligence possible."},{"start":412.76,"duration":3.88,"text":"So, the first component is graph-based"},{"start":414.68,"duration":4.04,"text":"entity correlation engine."},{"start":416.64,"duration":4.4,"text":"The role is to connect the entities"},{"start":418.72,"duration":4.8,"text":"across the payroll, tax, procurement,"},{"start":421.04,"duration":4.36,"text":"financial system into unified network."},{"start":423.52,"duration":3.8,"text":"Rather than analyzing the documents"},{"start":425.4,"duration":3.84,"text":"independently it"},{"start":427.32,"duration":4.44,"text":"it identifies the relationship between"},{"start":429.24,"duration":4.08,"text":"the employee, vendors, account,"},{"start":431.76,"duration":4.0,"text":"transaction,"},{"start":433.32,"duration":5.04,"text":"regulatory files. And these connections"},{"start":435.76,"duration":5.8,"text":"reveal the hidden pattern and structural"},{"start":438.36,"duration":5.08,"text":"anomalies that are often invisible to"},{"start":441.56,"duration":3.16,"text":"the traditional document level analysis"},{"start":443.44,"duration":4.12,"text":"we were doing."},{"start":444.72,"duration":4.64,"text":"In simple terms, this component answers"},{"start":447.56,"duration":5.24,"text":"one fundamental question, what is"},{"start":449.36,"duration":5.84,"text":"connected? It provides the relation"},{"start":452.8,"duration":5.28,"text":"relational fundamental for the rest of"},{"start":455.2,"duration":4.44,"text":"the framework. Once those relationships"},{"start":458.08,"duration":4.44,"text":"are established, the next step is"},{"start":459.64,"duration":6.68,"text":"determining which one actually"},{"start":462.52,"duration":3.8,"text":"represents the meaningful risk."},{"start":468.76,"duration":3.6,"text":"Once relationships have been"},{"start":470.24,"duration":4.32,"text":"established, the next step is to"},{"start":472.36,"duration":4.32,"text":"determine which one actually represents"},{"start":474.56,"duration":4.28,"text":"meaningful risk. That's the role of the"},{"start":476.68,"duration":4.52,"text":"adaptive probabilistic risk model."},{"start":478.84,"duration":4.84,"text":"Instead of relying on static rules, it"},{"start":481.2,"duration":5.32,"text":"combines the multiple risk indicators"},{"start":483.68,"duration":5.72,"text":"such as anomaly"},{"start":486.52,"duration":4.84,"text":"anomaly strength or the source"},{"start":489.4,"duration":4.76,"text":"reliability historic patterns has"},{"start":491.36,"duration":5.76,"text":"happened to calculate confidence best"},{"start":494.16,"duration":5.56,"text":"risk score. This helps prioritize the"},{"start":497.12,"duration":4.16,"text":"cases that require immediate attention"},{"start":499.72,"duration":4.44,"text":"while reducing the unnecessary"},{"start":501.28,"duration":6.52,"text":"investigations. The important advantage"},{"start":504.16,"duration":5.44,"text":"is its ability to learn from the audit"},{"start":507.8,"duration":3.88,"text":"outcomes, allowing the models to"},{"start":509.6,"duration":4.52,"text":"continuously improve its accuracy over"},{"start":511.68,"duration":5.0,"text":"the time. Simply put,"},{"start":514.12,"duration":4.6,"text":"this component answers the question that"},{"start":516.68,"duration":3.88,"text":"what is most likely to be genuine"},{"start":518.72,"duration":4.2,"text":"compliance risk."},{"start":520.56,"duration":4.72,"text":"Once we have identified the high-risk"},{"start":522.92,"duration":5.44,"text":"cases, the final step is to ensure those"},{"start":525.28,"duration":7.44,"text":"risk are interpreted consistently across"},{"start":528.36,"duration":5.88,"text":"the different regulatory environments."},{"start":532.72,"duration":3.56,"text":"The final component is"},{"start":534.24,"duration":4.8,"text":"cross-jurisdictional normalization"},{"start":536.28,"duration":5.44,"text":"layer. Global organizations operate"},{"start":539.04,"duration":5.36,"text":"across different countries, currencies,"},{"start":541.72,"duration":4.6,"text":"tax structure, and reporting standards."},{"start":544.4,"duration":3.6,"text":"Without normalization, the same"},{"start":546.32,"duration":3.0,"text":"transaction can be interpreted"},{"start":548.0,"duration":2.52,"text":"differently depending on the"},{"start":549.32,"duration":2.64,"text":"jurisdiction."},{"start":550.52,"duration":4.56,"text":"This layer"},{"start":551.96,"duration":7.44,"text":"harmonizes the financial data by"},{"start":555.08,"duration":5.72,"text":"standardizing the currencies, tax rules,"},{"start":559.4,"duration":3.76,"text":"the reporting periods, and the"},{"start":560.8,"duration":4.08,"text":"classification schemes as well. As a"},{"start":563.16,"duration":4.36,"text":"result, the risk are evaluated"},{"start":564.88,"duration":5.48,"text":"consistently regardless of where the"},{"start":567.52,"duration":5.44,"text":"where it has originated. In short, this"},{"start":570.36,"duration":4.88,"text":"component answers to the question, \"How"},{"start":572.96,"duration":5.28,"text":"should the risk be interpreted within"},{"start":575.24,"duration":4.64,"text":"the appropriate regulatory context?\""},{"start":578.24,"duration":3.2,"text":"With all these components working"},{"start":579.88,"duration":3.76,"text":"together, the next step was the"},{"start":581.44,"duration":6.48,"text":"evaluated how the framework performs"},{"start":583.64,"duration":4.28,"text":"under real-world enterprise conditions."},{"start":588.0,"duration":3.76,"text":"So, before discussing the result, let's"},{"start":590.84,"duration":3.04,"text":"um"},{"start":591.76,"duration":4.24,"text":"uh it's it's very important to uh"},{"start":593.88,"duration":5.04,"text":"briefly understand the evaluation of the"},{"start":596.0,"duration":5.64,"text":"environment. The framework was evaluated"},{"start":598.92,"duration":5.4,"text":"using the approximately 3 million of the"},{"start":601.64,"duration":4.44,"text":"financial records collected over 5 years"},{"start":604.32,"duration":3.6,"text":"of period over the four different"},{"start":606.08,"duration":4.56,"text":"regulatory jurisdictions."},{"start":607.92,"duration":4.72,"text":"The objective was to assess how the"},{"start":610.64,"duration":4.8,"text":"framework perform under the real"},{"start":612.64,"duration":5.56,"text":"realistic uh enterprise condition and"},{"start":615.44,"duration":5.56,"text":"where uh large volume of interconnected"},{"start":618.2,"duration":4.56,"text":"financial data and varying regulatory uh"},{"start":621.0,"duration":3.36,"text":"requirement introduce the significant"},{"start":622.76,"duration":3.36,"text":"complexity here."},{"start":624.36,"duration":4.2,"text":"Uh with that foundation established,"},{"start":626.12,"duration":3.52,"text":"let's look at how the framework perform."},{"start":628.56,"duration":3.2,"text":"So,"},{"start":629.64,"duration":5.24,"text":"how effective was the framework in"},{"start":631.76,"duration":6.0,"text":"detecting hidden compliance risk? Let's"},{"start":634.88,"duration":5.96,"text":"look at the results."},{"start":637.76,"duration":5.32,"text":"So, here now uh look at the detection"},{"start":640.84,"duration":5.36,"text":"performances. The framework achieved"},{"start":643.08,"duration":5.48,"text":"approximately 91% of precision, meaning"},{"start":646.2,"duration":5.48,"text":"the vast majority of the flat cases were"},{"start":648.56,"duration":4.96,"text":"confirmed as a genuine anomalies here."},{"start":651.68,"duration":5.4,"text":"At"},{"start":653.52,"duration":6.6,"text":"um it also achieved 87%"},{"start":657.08,"duration":6.08,"text":"um recalls, demonstrating its ability to"},{"start":660.12,"duration":6.2,"text":"identify most true fraud cases while"},{"start":663.16,"duration":4.08,"text":"minimal uh minimizing the misdetections"},{"start":666.32,"duration":4.08,"text":"here."},{"start":667.24,"duration":6.8,"text":"So, together, these results produce a F1"},{"start":670.4,"duration":5.64,"text":"score that is 0.89,"},{"start":674.04,"duration":3.68,"text":"indicating a strong balance between the"},{"start":676.04,"duration":4.08,"text":"precision and recall here. More"},{"start":677.72,"duration":4.36,"text":"importantly, these results are achieved"},{"start":680.12,"duration":3.92,"text":"across four jurisdictions and large"},{"start":682.08,"duration":4.08,"text":"enterprise scale data, demonstrating"},{"start":684.04,"duration":4.44,"text":"that the framework performs consistently"},{"start":686.16,"duration":5.4,"text":"in the complex real-world uh"},{"start":688.48,"duration":5.44,"text":"environments. The next question is um"},{"start":691.56,"duration":4.84,"text":"equally important. How do these"},{"start":693.92,"duration":4.72,"text":"improvements translate into operational"},{"start":696.4,"duration":4.52,"text":"value for the compliance teams?"},{"start":698.64,"duration":5.8,"text":"Detection accuracy is one part of the"},{"start":700.92,"duration":5.32,"text":"story. The real value um comes from"},{"start":704.44,"duration":2.92,"text":"improving the efficiency of the"},{"start":706.24,"duration":3.8,"text":"compliance"},{"start":707.36,"duration":5.08,"text":"operations."},{"start":710.04,"duration":4.16,"text":"Beyond detection accuracy, the framework"},{"start":712.44,"duration":3.84,"text":"delivers measurable operational"},{"start":714.2,"duration":5.6,"text":"benefits. One of the most significant"},{"start":716.28,"duration":5.12,"text":"outcome was a 76% uh reduction in false"},{"start":719.8,"duration":4.84,"text":"positive meaning"},{"start":721.4,"duration":6.4,"text":"um investigators spend uh far less than"},{"start":724.64,"duration":5.64,"text":"reviewing the cases that they uh they're"},{"start":727.8,"duration":4.6,"text":"ultimately legitimate."},{"start":730.28,"duration":4.36,"text":"So, in addition, the framework reduces"},{"start":732.4,"duration":4.64,"text":"the manual audit efforts by"},{"start":734.64,"duration":4.0,"text":"approximately 40% allowing compliance"},{"start":737.04,"duration":4.36,"text":"teams to be focused on the only"},{"start":738.64,"duration":5.52,"text":"high-risk cases instead of uh routing"},{"start":741.4,"duration":4.72,"text":"the document reviews. Ultimately, uh"},{"start":744.16,"duration":4.52,"text":"this translates into faster"},{"start":746.12,"duration":5.16,"text":"investigations, improved uh resource"},{"start":748.68,"duration":4.84,"text":"utilization, and uh greater confidence"},{"start":751.28,"duration":6.04,"text":"in compliance decisions. In other words,"},{"start":753.52,"duration":6.12,"text":"the uh the framework doesn't just detect"},{"start":757.32,"duration":5.44,"text":"fraud more effectively, it helps"},{"start":759.64,"duration":5.28,"text":"compliance teams work more effectively."},{"start":762.76,"duration":4.92,"text":"So, these operational improvements"},{"start":764.92,"duration":5.8,"text":"become even more meaningful when we"},{"start":767.68,"duration":6.76,"text":"compare uh the uh the framework with the"},{"start":770.72,"duration":3.72,"text":"traditional rule-based approaches."},{"start":778.04,"duration":3.76,"text":"This comparison highlights the advantage"},{"start":780.28,"duration":3.52,"text":"of moving beyond the traditional"},{"start":781.8,"duration":4.56,"text":"rule-based system. Uh conventional"},{"start":783.8,"duration":4.88,"text":"approaches are effective at validating"},{"start":786.36,"duration":4.76,"text":"the individual records, but they often"},{"start":788.68,"duration":4.76,"text":"struggle to detect the complex fraud"},{"start":791.12,"duration":4.32,"text":"patterns uh that spans multiple uh"},{"start":793.44,"duration":4.28,"text":"documents and systems."},{"start":795.44,"duration":3.96,"text":"So, by incorporating entity uh"},{"start":797.72,"duration":4.52,"text":"correlation, probabilistic risk"},{"start":799.4,"duration":6.08,"text":"modeling, and regulatory normalization,"},{"start":802.24,"duration":6.0,"text":"the uh proposed framework consistently"},{"start":805.48,"duration":5.32,"text":"um performs the baseline across the key"},{"start":808.24,"duration":5.2,"text":"performance metrics. The key takeaway is"},{"start":810.8,"duration":4.96,"text":"simple. Connecting data across documents"},{"start":813.44,"duration":4.64,"text":"produces better detection, fewer false"},{"start":815.76,"duration":4.88,"text":"positive, and more actionable, uh,"},{"start":818.08,"duration":5.92,"text":"compliance intelligence than analyzing"},{"start":820.64,"duration":6.04,"text":"the documents is, um, in in isolations."},{"start":824.0,"duration":5.04,"text":"One of the reason the framework"},{"start":826.68,"duration":4.76,"text":"continues to improve over the time is"},{"start":829.04,"duration":4.52,"text":"that, uh, doesn't rely on the static"},{"start":831.44,"duration":3.92,"text":"rules anymore. Instead, it continuously"},{"start":833.56,"duration":3.2,"text":"learn from the completed audit and"},{"start":835.36,"duration":5.2,"text":"investigate,"},{"start":836.76,"duration":3.8,"text":"uh, and the investigator feedbacks here."},{"start":840.6,"duration":4.28,"text":"So, this framework is designed to"},{"start":842.68,"duration":5.12,"text":"continuously improve through the"},{"start":844.88,"duration":5.56,"text":"feedback. Every, uh, completed audit"},{"start":847.8,"duration":4.8,"text":"provides the valuable information. Uh,"},{"start":850.44,"duration":4.52,"text":"confirm the fraud case, strengthen the"},{"start":852.6,"duration":5.0,"text":"future detection pattern. While false"},{"start":854.96,"duration":5.16,"text":"positive helps refining the risk scoring"},{"start":857.6,"duration":4.88,"text":"and reduce the unnecessary alerts. This"},{"start":860.12,"duration":4.92,"text":"create a continuous learning cycle where"},{"start":862.48,"duration":5.0,"text":"the system becomes more accurate with"},{"start":865.04,"duration":5.84,"text":"each audit and investigation."},{"start":867.48,"duration":5.88,"text":"As fraud patterns evolve and business,"},{"start":870.88,"duration":4.4,"text":"uh, environments changes, the framework"},{"start":873.36,"duration":4.44,"text":"adopts rather than relying on manual"},{"start":875.28,"duration":5.04,"text":"rule updates. In simple terms, every"},{"start":877.8,"duration":5.64,"text":"completed audit helps make the next"},{"start":880.32,"duration":5.56,"text":"audit more efficient. This continue, uh,"},{"start":883.44,"duration":5.44,"text":"continue learning, uh, capability"},{"start":885.88,"duration":5.72,"text":"enables a broader shift here. From"},{"start":888.88,"duration":5.64,"text":"reactive to compliance issue after they"},{"start":891.6,"duration":6.0,"text":"occur to identifying the risk before"},{"start":894.52,"duration":6.84,"text":"they become audit, uh, findings here."},{"start":897.6,"duration":3.76,"text":"It's more of a proactive."},{"start":902.32,"duration":4.52,"text":"Beyond improving detection accuracy,"},{"start":904.44,"duration":4.4,"text":"this framework changes how organization"},{"start":906.84,"duration":4.16,"text":"approach compliances."},{"start":908.84,"duration":5.12,"text":"Traditionally, the compliance has been"},{"start":911.0,"duration":5.2,"text":"reactive. Issue were identified after"},{"start":913.96,"duration":4.6,"text":"audits, investigation, or regulatory"},{"start":916.2,"duration":4.8,"text":"reviews have happened. This framework"},{"start":918.56,"duration":4.52,"text":"enables more proactive approach through"},{"start":921.0,"duration":4.48,"text":"continuous uh monitoring cross"},{"start":923.08,"duration":4.6,"text":"document correlation, adaptive learning."},{"start":925.48,"duration":4.56,"text":"Instead of asking what went wrong,"},{"start":927.68,"duration":5.28,"text":"organizations can begin asking what is"},{"start":930.04,"duration":6.16,"text":"likely to go wrong next. That shifts"},{"start":932.96,"duration":4.88,"text":"from reactive validation to predictive"},{"start":936.2,"duration":4.04,"text":"governance, allowing the compliance"},{"start":937.84,"duration":4.36,"text":"teams to identify the risk earlier,"},{"start":940.24,"duration":4.8,"text":"prioritize the investigation more"},{"start":942.2,"duration":5.2,"text":"effectively, and make better informed"},{"start":945.04,"duration":4.28,"text":"decisions. Ultimately, the compliance"},{"start":947.4,"duration":4.16,"text":"becomes an ongoing intelligence"},{"start":949.32,"duration":4.6,"text":"functions rather than a periodic review"},{"start":951.56,"duration":4.8,"text":"process."},{"start":953.92,"duration":4.64,"text":"While the framework is uh research"},{"start":956.36,"duration":4.28,"text":"driven, it has been designed with the"},{"start":958.56,"duration":4.72,"text":"enterprise deployment in mind."},{"start":960.64,"duration":4.52,"text":"Successful implementation depends on uh"},{"start":963.28,"duration":4.12,"text":"four key consideration. First one is"},{"start":965.16,"duration":4.56,"text":"seamless integration with existing"},{"start":967.4,"duration":3.88,"text":"enterprise systems such as ERP, payroll,"},{"start":969.72,"duration":4.16,"text":"procurement tax"},{"start":971.28,"duration":5.08,"text":"uh tax platforms. Second, the"},{"start":973.88,"duration":5.04,"text":"jurisdictional specific uh configuration"},{"start":976.36,"duration":5.44,"text":"to ensure the compliance with local"},{"start":978.92,"duration":4.8,"text":"regulations and reporting standards."},{"start":981.8,"duration":5.12,"text":"Third one is um"},{"start":983.72,"duration":5.32,"text":"alignment with the audit framework"},{"start":986.92,"duration":4.84,"text":"enabling the investigator to focus on"},{"start":989.04,"duration":5.2,"text":"prioritized risk code cases instead of"},{"start":991.76,"duration":4.92,"text":"manual document reviews. And finally,"},{"start":994.24,"duration":4.56,"text":"scalability. The evaluation demonstrate"},{"start":996.68,"duration":5.92,"text":"that the framework can effectively"},{"start":998.8,"duration":5.32,"text":"process millions of financial records um"},{"start":1002.6,"duration":3.32,"text":"making it suitable for the large"},{"start":1004.12,"duration":5.36,"text":"enterprise environments."},{"start":1005.92,"duration":5.64,"text":"Uh so, together these uh consi- these"},{"start":1009.48,"duration":4.04,"text":"considerations help bridge the gap"},{"start":1011.56,"duration":5.28,"text":"between the research and the practical"},{"start":1013.52,"duration":3.32,"text":"enterprise adoption."},{"start":1017.84,"duration":5.68,"text":"As I conclude, I would like to leave you"},{"start":1020.04,"duration":5.6,"text":"with four key takeaways. First is many"},{"start":1023.52,"duration":3.96,"text":"of today's most significant compliance"},{"start":1025.64,"duration":5.04,"text":"and fraud risk exist between the"},{"start":1027.48,"duration":6.56,"text":"documents, not within them."},{"start":1030.68,"duration":5.48,"text":"Detecting these risk require more beyond"},{"start":1034.04,"duration":4.96,"text":"document level analysis and cross"},{"start":1036.16,"duration":4.68,"text":"document intelligence."},{"start":1039.0,"duration":4.24,"text":"Second is combining the graph based"},{"start":1040.84,"duration":4.32,"text":"entity correlation, probabilistic risk"},{"start":1043.24,"duration":3.68,"text":"modeling, and cross jurisdictional"},{"start":1045.16,"duration":4.2,"text":"normalization creates a more"},{"start":1046.92,"duration":4.16,"text":"comprehensive and scalable approach to"},{"start":1049.36,"duration":5.64,"text":"enterprise compliance."},{"start":1051.08,"duration":5.08,"text":"Third is the result demonstrated that"},{"start":1055.0,"duration":3.6,"text":"this"},{"start":1056.16,"duration":4.44,"text":"particular framework is not only"},{"start":1058.6,"duration":3.52,"text":"improves the detection accuracy, but"},{"start":1060.6,"duration":3.24,"text":"also"},{"start":1062.12,"duration":4.16,"text":"reduces the false positive and"},{"start":1063.84,"duration":4.12,"text":"significantly lowers the manual audit"},{"start":1066.28,"duration":3.92,"text":"efforts, delivering the measurable"},{"start":1067.96,"duration":4.12,"text":"operational value. Finally, by"},{"start":1070.2,"duration":5.32,"text":"continuous learning from the audit"},{"start":1072.08,"duration":5.32,"text":"outcomes, and the framework enables"},{"start":1075.52,"duration":4.6,"text":"the organizations to move beyond"},{"start":1077.4,"duration":4.72,"text":"reactive compliance toward predictive"},{"start":1080.12,"duration":4.56,"text":"intelligence driven"},{"start":1082.12,"duration":4.0,"text":"risk management here. I believe this"},{"start":1084.68,"duration":3.76,"text":"represents an"},{"start":1086.12,"duration":4.84,"text":"important step toward the future of"},{"start":1088.44,"duration":5.36,"text":"enterprise financial govern- governance,"},{"start":1090.96,"duration":6.08,"text":"where AI is not only helping the"},{"start":1093.8,"duration":5.6,"text":"organizations to detect risk, but also"},{"start":1097.04,"duration":6.52,"text":"anticipates and"},{"start":1099.4,"duration":4.16,"text":"prevent this risk going forward."},{"start":1105.08,"duration":5.28,"text":"So, thank you once again to the AI"},{"start":1107.8,"duration":4.88,"text":"Engineering World Fest team for this"},{"start":1110.36,"duration":5.0,"text":"wonderful opportunity, and thank you all"},{"start":1112.68,"duration":4.64,"text":"for your time and attention. Please feel"},{"start":1115.36,"duration":4.4,"text":"free to reach out to me"},{"start":1117.32,"duration":5.76,"text":"with your questions and your enthusiasm"},{"start":1119.76,"duration":6.24,"text":"on this email below, or connect me on"},{"start":1123.08,"duration":6.0,"text":"the LinkedIn. I'm happy to help you. If"},{"start":1126.0,"duration":6.4,"text":"you're building with such kind of"},{"start":1129.08,"duration":6.48,"text":"amazing systems for compliances using"},{"start":1132.4,"duration":7.92,"text":"the AI wanted to transform them, and"},{"start":1135.56,"duration":4.76,"text":"thank you all again. See you next time."}]}